  "summaries": {
    "en": "Combo building, leader skill synergy, awakening analysis, and dungeon-specific team construction for Puzzle & Dragons.",
    "ja": "コンボ構築、リーダースキルシナジー、覚醒スキル分析、ダンジョン専用チーム構成を解説するパズル&ドラゴンズ攻略ガイド。"
  },
  "category": "puzzle",
  "difficulty": "intermediate",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564507592333-c60657eea523?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "Combo count is the primary damage multiplier—most leader skills activate at 6+ combos (6-combo threshold provides the most common multiplier tier). Practice building 6 combos reliably before optimising for 7 or 8.",
      "Leader Skill pairing (your Leader + Friend Leader) doubles the leadership bonus—always pair with a Friend Leader that has the same activation condition as your own Leader, or a complementary condition (e.g., HP-boost Leader pairs with ATK-boost Friend Leader).",
      "Awakening Skills accumulate per monster and provide passive bonuses—prioritise monsters with 7 awakening slots with useful abilities (Skill Boost, Resistance to Blind, Team HP+) over same-rarity monsters with fewer high-value awakenings.",
      "Skyfall combos (orbs falling after a clear creating additional matches) can exceed the planned combo count—set up L-shaped or Z-shaped orb configurations after your planned combos to maximise skyfall probability.",
      "Arena and Descended dungeons require void damage nullification—enemies with damage void absorb all damage in a specific turn. Bring at least one Resolve or Damage Void piercing monster to prevent complete turns of wasted damage."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "コンボ数は主要なダメージ乗数。ほとんどのリーダースキルは6コンボ以上で発動する（6コンボ閾値は最も一般的な乗数ティアを提供する）。7や8コンボに最適化する前に、確実に6コンボを構築する練習をする。",
      "リーダースキルのペアリング（自分のリーダー+フレンドリーダー）はリーダーシップボーナスを2倍にする。常に自分のリーダーと同じ発動条件を持つフレンドリーダーか、補完的な条件（HPブーストリーダーはATKブーストフレンドリーダーとペアを組む等）でペアを組む。",
      "覚醒スキルはモンスターごとに蓄積しパッシブボーナスを提供する。有用な覚醒スロットが少ない同レアリティのモンスターより、有用な能力（スキルブースト、バインド耐性、チームHP+）で7覚醒スロットを持つモンスターを優先する。",
      "スカイフォールコンボ（クリア後に落下するオーブが追加マッチを生成）は計画したコンボ数を超える可能性がある。スカイフォール確率を最大化するために計画コンボ後にL字型またはZ字型のオーブ配置を設定する。",
      "アリーナと降臨ダンジョンはダメージ無効の無効化が必要。ダメージ無効を持つ敵は特定のターンに全ダメージを吸収する。完全に無駄なダメージのターンを防ぐために、少なくとも1体のリゾルブまたはダメージ無効貫通モンスターを連れてくる。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Orb Movement Mastery",
        "body": "The orb-movement system allows sliding orbs continuously for 5 seconds per turn. The first skill to master is the \"L-shape\" move: position one colour in an L-shape (3 in a row + 2 more adjacent) to guarantee 2 combos from a single connected movement. Practise the L-shape on every turn regardless of whether the dungeon requires it—the habit of planning 2+ combos from every move is the foundational skill that makes 6-combo planning possible."
      },
      {
        "title": "Team Building for New Players",
        "body": "Build your first team around the strongest Leader you pull with a matching sub that activates the same skill. For early game, prioritise: Leader with 2× ATK multiplier at 4+ combos, 1 sub with a board changer skill (converts all orbs to a different set), 1 healer sub (HP recovery active), and fill remaining slots with your highest-ATK elemental subs matching the Leader's primary element. The board changer sub is the single most important active skill in the game—it creates a guaranteed 6-combo setup from a cleared board."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Skill Inheritance System",
        "body": "Skill Inheritance (Inherit) allows transferring a monster's active skill to another monster. This enables hybrid builds: mount a board-changer active on a high-ATK attacker to give that attacker both high damage and board manipulation. The key restriction: the inherited skill cooldown resets to the base monster's cooldown, not the inherit monster's. Always check the inherited skill's cooldown is within your dungeon's required skill-use frequency before finalising an Inherit loadout."
      },
      {
        "title": "Latent Awakening Priority",
        "body": "Latent Awakening slots (added via Tamadra feeding) provide bonus stats not available through normal awakenings. Priority latents for physical attackers: ATK+ (flat attack bonus), Physical Type Killer (for specific dungeon applications). Priority for HP-focused teams: HP+ latents on every member. Latent Awakenings cannot be removed after addition—research the optimal latents for your team's primary dungeon target before investing Tamadra."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Super Reincarnation and Assist Evolution",
        "body": "Super Reincarnation evolution provides the highest available stat values for top-tier monsters. The process requires specific evolution materials obtainable only from high-difficulty dungeons. Assist Evolution converts a monster specifically into an Assist (equipment) that provides unique bonus skills when inherited—Assist Evolved monsters have higher effect values than non-evolved assists of the same monster. Prioritise Super Reincarnation on your primary Leader before Assist-evolving support monsters."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Moving orbs too quickly without planning the full combo path—taking the full 5 seconds per turn for orb movement consistently enables more combos than rushing; build the habit of pausing 1 second to plan before starting movement.",
      "Ignoring resistance awakenings on subs—Bind resistance, Blind resistance, and Jammer resistance awakenings prevent dungeon-specific debuffs that can completely disable turns; include resistance-stacking subs in dungeons that use these debuffs.",
      "Pairing Leaders that have conflicting activation conditions—a Leader that requires low HP and a Friend Leader that requires high HP cannot both activate in most turns; always verify that both Leader conditions can be simultaneously met.",
      "Spending Magic Stones (premium currency) on standard gachas—Rare Egg Machine (standard gacha) has the same drop rates year-round; Seasonal Gachas (higher rates for seasonal monsters) and Collab Gachas (high rates for collaboration monsters) provide significantly better value.",
      "Not checking dungeons' specific mechanics in the enemy database before attempting—many mid-game dungeons have specific preemptive attacks that delete HP if conditions are not met; understanding the first turn's enemy ability prevents instant fails."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "完全なコンボパスを計画せずにオーブを素早く動かす。オーブ移動に毎ターン5秒を使い切ることで、急ぐよりも一貫して多くのコンボが可能になる。動きを始める前に1秒間計画を立てる習慣を築く。",
      "サブの耐性覚醒を無視する。バインド耐性、暗闇耐性、妨害耐性覚醒はターンを完全に無効化できるダンジョン固有のデバフを防ぐ。これらのデバフを使うダンジョンでは耐性スタックサブを含める。",
      "相反する発動条件を持つリーダーをペアにする。HP低下を必要とするリーダーとHP維持を必要とするフレンドリーダーはほとんどのターンで両方を発動できない。常に両方のリーダー条件が同時に満たせることを確認する。",
      "標準ガチャにマジックストーン（プレミアム通貨）を使う。レアエッグマシン（標準ガチャ）は年中同じドロップ率を持つ。季節ガチャ（季節モンスターの高率）とコラボガチャ（コラボモンスターの高率）はかなり良い価値を提供する。",
      "試みる前にダンジョンの特定のメカニックを敵データベースで確認しない。多くの中盤ダンジョンには条件が満たされない場合にHPを削除する特定の先制攻撃がある。最初のターンの敵の能力を理解することで即時失敗を防ぐ。"
    ]
  },
